    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A front row seat to life on the River Shannon.\n\nSheehy Meares Real Estate are delighted to present 22 Bastion Quay. Set on the third floor of this sought after development this beautifully finished three bedroom apartment offers generous living space and a large private balcony with views across the River Shannon.\n\nThe sense of style begins in the entrance hall where a curved feature wall creates a memorable first impression. From here the apartment opens into a spacious kitchen and living area filled with natural light. It is a welcoming space whether you are settling in for a quiet evening or having friends over.\n\nThe galley style kitchen combines sleek grey fitted units with plenty of storage and worktop space. Integrated appliances include a fridge freezer and dishwasher while a dedicated wine fridge brings a little extra luxury. Designer ceiling lighting adds character to the room.\n\nIn the living area floor to ceiling patio doors frame the river view and lead directly onto the private balcony. This is the spot that makes the apartment special. Enjoy breakfast outdoors on a bright morning or wind down in the evening as boats make their way along the Shannon. The balcony gives you space to pause and enjoy the setting right outside your door.\n\nThere are three generously sized bedrooms each with floor to ceiling built in wardrobes. The main bedroom has an ensuite shower room. The second bedroom offers direct access to the main bathroom which can also be reached from the hallway through a Jack and Jill layout featuring a second baloncy with beautiful surrounding views. A separate utility area adds useful storage and keeps the everyday essentials neatly out of sight.\n\nThe apartment also benefits from gas fired central heating and designated parking. With Athlone town centre close at hand you can enjoy the convenience of a central address alongside the pleasure of living by the river.\n\nBeautifully presented and wonderfully positioned 22 Bastion Quay is a home that deserves to be seen in person.\n\nContact Karyn Marsh 085 844 5355 / karyn@sheehymeares.ie OR Donna Hynes (090) 647 3838 / info@hynes.ie"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER To be advised\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Bastion Quay puts the best of Athlone close to home. Step out to the cafes and restaurants of the Left Bank or take a stroll by the Shannon. Athlone Castle and Luan Gallery are nearby while the town centre offers shops and everyday amenities. Athlone train station is also within walking distance. It is a setting where you can enjoy the buzz of town life and come home to river views"
      },
      {
